## PDF output
# Compiled PDFs are not tracked (the journal manuscript is under review; no preprint lives here).
# The source documents of the two benchmark corpora ARE published: un-ignore them explicitly.
*.pdf
!RnD/input/*.pdf
!RnD/smoking/**/*.pdf
*.dvi
*.ps

## Linux & Editor Artifacts
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*

## IDE/Tooling Caches
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/

## Frozen LanceDB tables under RnD/db/ ARE published
# The Python template above ignores *.manifest (PyInstaller); LanceDB stores its table versions as
# _versions/*.manifest, so un-ignore them here. There is deliberately no *.lance rule.
!RnD/db/**/*.manifest

## Safeguards: material that must never reach the public repository
# records of source papers whose licences do not permit redistribution (kept locally, see README)
RnD/private_records/
# supervisor's notes, earlier sources and drafts of the manuscript
RnD/nature_article/writing-references/
# extracted figure images of the source papers
RnD/input/Robi_kutatasok/
RnD/images/
# router exemplar pool: six non-redistributable papers and their chunk files (rebuilt locally with
# dynamic_slice_length/router_experiments/scripts/chunk_router_docs.py for re-runs); the public copy ships the ten
# exemplar passages in RnD/dynamic_slice_length/router_exemplars_heldout.json instead
RnD/input_router/
RnD/split_documents_router/
